  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Countering Violent Extremism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the CBOs capacities to tackle violent extremism at the local level. In specific the project aims to increase understanding of the institutional capacities of 15 selected CBOs to successfully implement grassroots Preventive and Countering Violent Extremism (P/CVE)  relevant projects and to improve the CBOs institutional capacity to implement effective projects in the field of P/CVE.</narrative>
  </description>
